{"total": 38.14, "segs": [{"start": 0.15, "end": 2.9499999999999997, "text": "Em Campinas, você perde cliente no mesmo lugar.", "wt": [0.15, 0.27, 0.77, 1.07, 1.43, 2.05, 2.15, 2.39]}, {"start": 3.2499999999999996, "end": 5.75, "text": "Ele pede o preço, diz que vai pensar e some.", "wt": [3.2499999999999996, 3.3899999999999997, 3.6699999999999995, 3.7699999999999996, 4.25, 4.449999999999999, 4.59, 4.7299999999999995, 5.109999999999999, 5.33]}, {"start": 6.05, "end": 10.96, "text": "Seguidor. Curtida. Indicação. Nenhum deles diz quem vai fechar.", "wt": [6.05, 6.95, 7.91, 9.03, 9.23, 9.53, 9.89, 10.17, 10.39]}, {"start": 11.260000000000002, "end": 16.580000000000002, "text": "Nutricionista, consórcio, dentista, advogado: vocês vendem uma decisão que o cliente adia.", "wt": [11.260000000000002, 12.160000000000002, 12.780000000000001, 13.440000000000001, 14.320000000000002, 14.440000000000001, 14.900000000000002, 15.080000000000002, 15.560000000000002, 15.680000000000001, 15.740000000000002, 16.14]}, {"start": 16.880000000000003, "end": 21.28, "text": "Treze anos de marketing me mostraram: a venda não morre no preço. Morre no intervalo.", "wt": [16.880000000000003, 17.12, 17.360000000000003, 17.540000000000003, 17.94, 18.160000000000004, 18.800000000000004, 18.880000000000003, 19.14, 19.28, 19.560000000000002, 19.64, 20.28, 20.620000000000005, 20.700000000000003]}, {"start": 21.630000000000003, "end": 26.71, "text": "Lançamento encurta esse intervalo: pesquisa, oferta na ordem certa, aquecimento e prazo real.", "wt": [21.630000000000003, 22.090000000000003, 22.51, 22.610000000000003, 23.37, 24.070000000000004, 24.35, 24.51, 24.770000000000003, 25.270000000000003, 25.790000000000003, 25.950000000000003, 26.270000000000003]}, {"start": 27.01, "end": 31.840000000000003, "text": "Por isso todo especialista precisa de um estrategista: você atende, e eu desenho e comando.", "wt": [27.01, 27.130000000000003, 27.310000000000002, 27.51, 28.150000000000002, 28.51, 28.73, 28.810